schema: claim-evidence
object:
  title: ReFi DAO Local Nodes in Costa Rica, Barcelona, Tanzania, and Mexico
  type: claim-evidence
  claim: >-
    "They [ReFi DAO] have helped start Local Nodes in places like Costa Rica,
    Barcelona, Tanzania, and Mexico," each focused on local environmental
    challenges (e.g. ReFi Costa Rica merging crypto philanthropy with
    grassroots activism, ReFi Tanzania addressing urban waste, ReFi BayArea
    integrating solar energy with regenerative real estate).
  evidence: >-
    Stated in the article's "Real Examples You Can Understand" section; cites
    "refidao.local" in the References list (an internal/informal reference,
    not a resolvable public URL at ingestion time).
  source_lineage: "src/content/docs/examples-impact-daos.md (References: refidao.local)"
  interpretation: >-
    Consistent with ReFi DAO's public Local Nodes model described in other
    site articles (e.g. find-your-community.md references
    refidao.com/local-nodes as the live, sortable directory).
  uncertainty: >-
    The specific node roster (Costa Rica, Barcelona, Tanzania, Mexico,
    BayArea) is a point-in-time snapshot from the article; ReFi DAO's Local
    Nodes directory changes over time and should be checked live at
    refidao.com/local-nodes rather than trusted as current from this article
    alone. The cited "refidao.local" reference does not resolve to a public
    URL.
  maturity: raw
  ai_assisted: true
  provenance:
    origin: src/content/docs/examples-impact-daos.md
    transformation: summarized
    authorship: ai-assisted
